<title>FRANCE: Ffr at good level vs other Euro currencies-Arthuis.</title>
<headline>Ffr at good level vs other Euro currencies-Arthuis.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French franc is at a good level compared to other European currencies, French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The franc is at a good level vis-a-vis other European currencies,&quot; Arthuis told a conference.</p>
</text>
